WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.3 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Governance structures by legal form

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
You have governance from day one: decide who will direct and oversee, before you sign founding documents.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Match your governing body to the legal form you choose.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Start with an advisory group that advises but does not decide.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Plan for skills, independence and managed conflicts.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You describe the governance your form requires and the one you want.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
